{
  "name": "Social · News to social content engine",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "186adaeb-6b36-4e97-af9e-c2b637041d95",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 640,
        "height": 230,
        "content": "## Social · News to social content engine\nA form request picks a media brand. The workflow applies that brand's voice, reads its news feed, and for each article drafts a caption and an image with Gemini, checks its own output, and sends the draft to the social manager on Telegram. Approved moves to the next article; rejected is drafted again.\n\n**Platforms:** RSS, Gemini, Telegram\n**Source and tests:** github.com/kimjoshuadr/n8n-workflows · `production/social-content`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bcdbcc5e-7f2e-43da-ae01-731ce46b6773",
